        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solvents, organic, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solvents, organic, unspecified, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of an equal mixture of 15 of the most often used solvents. Large uncertainty due to the unweighted and randomly choice of included solvents.;
UUID: bac59fd2-5b1f-318c-8dae-c794cd786431
Mix of the 15 of the most often used organic solvents, having their own dataset within the database. Only input of the mentioned solvents is taken into account.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: data represent an equal mixture of different solvents.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Equal distribution of the different used solvents as no further information is available 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bac59fd2-5b1f-318c-8dae-c794cd786431.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
